/target/
*.wasm
node_modules/
.env

# Cargo.lock IS committed here, overriding the ignore rule that used to sit above.
#
# OutLayer compiles this example inside the enclave and attests the hash of the
# resulting wasm. An unpinned dependency graph means the same source can compile to a
# different binary, and a measurement nobody can reproduce is not much of a
# measurement.
#
# It also keeps the build working at all: the worker's compiler image is Rust 1.85, and
# an unpinned resolve pulls icu/idna versions that declare rustc 1.86 as their minimum.
!Cargo.lock
